<Base lang="en" page="privacy" title="Privacy · Traces Blanches" description="What stays on your phone, what you choose to send and what the Traces Blanches server receives.">
<div class="text">
<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p class="lead">Your position, your tracks and your plans stay on your phone. Nothing leaves it without a gesture from you.</p>
<div class="status"><p><b>The app is not in a store yet: it comes out in winter 2027.</b> This page describes what the code of the app does. Every change remains visible in <a rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/tracesblanches/tracesblanches.github.io/commits/main/src/pages/privacy.astro">the history of this page</a>.</p></div>
<ul class="toc">
<li><a href="#phone">On the phone</a></li>
<li><a href="#choice">What you choose to send</a></li>
<li><a href="#server">What the server receives</a></li>
